            <title>[IGNITE-5804] ScanQuery transformer applies to first results page only.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5804</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Issue is successfully reproduces on GridCacheQueryTransformerSelfTest if &lt;br/&gt;
set ScanQuery.pageSize much lower then cache size.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should rework GridCacheQueryTransformerSelfTest to run test on larger dataset &lt;br/&gt;
to make pagination used as well.&lt;/p&gt;

